# oracle: fix ilves on a lattice of 64 rigid dimers (128 atoms, the in.dimer pattern without the random create): tol 1e-4 iter 25, bonds of type 1, thermo temp (dof with the constraints), pe, press and every per-atom position, velocity and force after 50 steps
# oracle-inputs: w50il_dimer.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.4e-12, atoms 1.0e-10.
units           real
atom_style      bond
read_data       w50il_dimer.data
pair_style      lj/cut 8.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.1 2.0
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 100.0 1.0
special_bonds   lj 0.0 1.0 1.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
timestep        1.0
fix             1 all nve
fix             cons all ilves 1.0e-4 25 0 b 1
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
